enate me from maximus and pascal who  likely has already blended into the wall  so i can't even apologize to the poor  guy  and that's how it goes here at versus i  walked into this matchup expecting to  have some fun celebrating two modern  disney classics but i'll be darned if  this grinch didn't grow a heart and  remember how much i love mandy moore not  enough for me to check out this is us  but you know a walk to remember still  rocks and now it's your turn dear viewer  frozen winning is just my opinion and i  was rooting for tangle he's go crazy  but disney makes films designed to be  enjoyed by all so give me your take hit  me up on social media at mark ellis live  and head over to rottentomatoes.com for  a slew of deep dives into the best  animated films of the 2000s thanks for  watching versus i'm mark ellis and as  olaf would say i'm like a baby unicorn  [Music]  [Music]  you
 

